<title>UK: Astec 1996 earnings/shr up 16.6 pct to 8.55p.</title>
<headline>Astec 1996 earnings/shr up 16.6 pct to 8.55p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.55		   vs 7.33</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 1.8		    vs 1.5</p>
<p> Operating profit	 32.4		   vs 27.3</p>
<p> Pretax		     33.9		   vs 28.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   315		    vs 292.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British power coversion electronics specialist is Astec (BSR) Plc.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
</text>
